File icons in this directory are vendored from Seti UI.

Source: https://github.com/jesseweed/seti-ui
Version: 1.11.0 (commit 2d6c5e68b4ded73c92dac291845ee44e1182d511)
License: MIT (below)

Refresh with `./scripts/vendor-seti-icons.sh`. That script replaces the SVGs
only; the file-name and extension associations live in `src/file_icons.rs`,
because Seti publishes them as a VS Code font plus `languageIds` rather than as
an extension map that could be copied.

